# A bound narrowed between source and target: {a: 50} is a valid source instance the target rejects (#20).
-- source.cue --
a!: int
-- target.cue --
a!: int & <10
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {a: input.a}
-- out --
not total
result.a copies input.a, which is now int & <10, which does not accept every value of the prior int (compat rule value-narrowed) (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:13
